.TH GROUPS 1 "Riplix" "Ripple"
.SH NAME
groups \- print group membership
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
groups [user ...]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print group names for the current user or the named accounts. The current
system starts a root session and supplies its primary group.
